      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-02-11T16:28:53Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "OK but that doesn\u0027t explain how things work in the EC, where I almost never see interleaving. Is that accidental, or is there actually something at the prints() level?",
      "parentUuid": "b8be5ca0_48b0f129",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 34,
        "startChar": 14,
        "endLine": 34,
