      "writtenOn": "2021-02-11T16:36:09Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "ECOS does not have interleaved output as it uses cooperative scheduling, thus allowing the tasks to yield when they want instead of being preempted (and obviously tasks won\u0027t yield during a printf).\n\nWith Zephyr, we\u0027re using preemptive scheduling. So we need to add locking to the printf implementation to get output to not be interleaved.\n\nBut yeah, not related to this CL.",
      "parentUuid": "7b828f25_6dc759d1",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 34,
        "startChar": 14,
        "endLine": 34,
        "endChar": 32
